  "access_page": "<h1>Installer access</h1><form method=\"post\" action=\"/login\"><label>Setup password<input name=\"token\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"off\" required></label><button>Enter</button></form>",
  "setup_form": "<h1>Setup selection</h1><p>Installed: %s; existing modules: %s. Preserve keeps recorded settings and node credentials. Removed modules are not uninstalled; confirm removal from the selected install set explicitly.</p><form method=\"post\" action=\"/apply\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf\" value=\"%s\"><h2>Modules</h2>%s<h2>Proxy protocols</h2>%s<label>Existing configuration <select name=\"policy\"><option value=\"preserve\">Preserve</option><option value=\"reconfigure\">Reconfigure (destructive)</option></select></label><br><label>Type DELETE to confirm reconfiguration or removing a module: <input name=\"confirm\"></label><br><p>Unchecking an installed proxy protocol removes its configuration and credentials. Confirm each removal:</p>%s<label>Console password protection <select name=\"auth\"><option value=\"1\" %s>On</option><option value=\"0\" %s>Off</option></select></label><br><label>Public page <select name=\"public\"><option value=\"1\" %s>On</option><option value=\"0\" %s>Off</option></select></label><br><label>Console port (blank = existing or random) <input name=\"port\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></label><br><label>Language <select name=\"language\">%s</select></label><br><label>Lucky admin port (default 16601) <input name=\"lucky_port\" value=\"%s\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></label><br><label>Expose Lucky admin over public HTTP? Credentials are transmitted unencrypted. <select name=\"lucky_public\"><option value=\"0\" %s>No (default)</option><option value=\"1\" %s>Yes (requires separate server-terminal confirmation)</option></select></label><br><button>Apply selection and continue installer</button></form>",
